  "claim": "After releasing \"Hail to the Thief\" in June 2003, the  band Radiohead released the EP COM LAG in 2004.",
  "evidencia": "Page: COM LAG (2plus2isfive). Sentence: COM LAG (2plus2isfive) is the sixth compilation EP by the English rock band Radiohead, released in March 2004 in Japan and Australia.\nPage: COM LAG (2plus2isfive). Sentence: It is collects many of the B-sides from the singles from their 2003 album \"Hail to the Thief\", along with some live tracks and remixes by Cristian Vogel and Four Tet.\nPage: Hail to the Thief. Sentence: It was released on 9 June 2003, by Parlophone Records in the United Kingdom, and a day later by Capitol Records in the United States.",
