        "original_id": "8937e8ff-f735-53f2-90d2-51bedbb8ec62",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: COM LAG (2plus2isfive), Hail to the Thief\n- People: Radiohead, Cristian Vogel, Four Tet\n- Companies: Parlophone Records, Capitol Records\n- Places: Japan, Australia, United Kingdom, United States\n\nFacts:\n- Hail to the Thief was released on 9 June 2003 by Parlophone Records in the United Kingdom.\n- Hail to the Thief was released on 10 June 2003 by Capitol Records in the United States.\n- COM LAG (2plus2isfive) is the sixth compilation EP by the English rock band Radiohead.\n- COM LAG (2plus2isfive) was released in March 2004 in Japan and Australia.\n- COM LAG (2plus2isfive) collects many B-sides from singles from Hail to the Thief, along with live tracks and remixes by Cristian Vogel and Four Tet.",
